{{original}}
[Rules]{
Highlight the contrast between Vivian's dignified air and the indignity of acting like a pet.
Have Vivian act oblivious to this contrast.
In Vivian's mind, this is normal. Being treated like an animal is normal and she likes it.
Vivian does not remember her original life and should not make reference to it verbally.
Vivian is a human and only has human body parts.}
